    <li><b>Contact form.</b> The form on this site does not send data to our servers. It opens WhatsApp with your message ready, and nothing is sent until you press send in WhatsApp.</li>
    <li><b>Technical data.</b> Our hosting provider may automatically record standard server logs, such as IP address, browser type and pages requested, to keep the site secure and working.</li>
    <li><b>Demo assistant.</b> The demo assistant on the home page runs in your browser using prepared answers. What you type into it is not sent to us or stored.</li>
  </ul>

